# 统一换行与编码：仓库内一律 LF + UTF-8，避免 Windows 上 diff 全是换行噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf

# 二进制，不做文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# 差异对比
*.html diff
*.js   diff
*.css  diff
